        <part lastModifyTime="0" updateMethod="0">
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="1">
                <start-time>00:00:04,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:07,123</end-time>
                <translation>在当今全球化社会中</translation>
                <original>今グローバル社会の中で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="2">
                <start-time>00:00:07,123</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:09,775</end-time>
                <translation>需要出色的谈判技巧</translation>
                <original>優れた交渉術を持つことが求められています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="3">
                <start-time>00:00:13,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:17,275</end-time>
                <translation>能给予我们对此的启示的正是《君主论》</translation>
                <original>そのヒントを与えてくれるのが君主論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="4">
                <start-time>00:00:17,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:21,655</end-time>
                <translation>身为外交官的作者马基雅维利的谈判秘诀是什么</translation>
                <original>外交官だった作者マキャベリーの交渉の極意とは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="5">
                <start-time>00:00:25,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:28,775</end-time>
                <translation>100分de名著《君主论》</translation>
                <original>100分de名著君主論</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="6">
                <start-time>00:00:28,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:34,775</end-time>
                <translation>指导者是翻译了马基雅维利全集的武田好老师</translation>
                <original>指南役はマキャベリー全集の翻訳を手掛けた武田好さん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="7">
                <start-time>00:00:34,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:39,675</end-time>
                <translation>此外 我们迎来了前外交官东乡和彦先生作为嘉宾</translation>
                <original>そしてゲストに元外交官の東郷和彦さんを迎えます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="8">
                <start-time>00:00:39,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:41,624</end-time>
                <translation>尽可能多地收集信息</translation>
                <original>情報をどれだけ集めて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="9">
                <start-time>00:00:41,624</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:46,000</end-time>
                <translation>进行分析 并将其写下来送回本国</translation>
                <original>分析をしてそれを本国に書き記すということなんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="10">
                <start-time>00:00:46,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:48,465</end-time>
                <translation>有时也会巧妙地运用计谋</translation>
                <original>時にはスマイをうまく使って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="11">
                <start-time>00:00:48,465</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:51,175</end-time>
                <translation>从他人那里收集信息</translation>
                <original>人から情報を集めていたんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="12">
                <start-time>00:00:52,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:59,540</end-time>
                <translation>从《君主论》中解读马基雅维利在现代依然适用的精明谈判诀窍</translation>
                <original>現代にも通じるマキャベリーの賢い交渉の壺君主論から読み解きます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="13">
                <start-time>00:01:22,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:28,300</end-time>
                <translation>第4回　“精明谈判的诀窍”
第4回　「賢い交渉のツボ」</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="14">
                <start-time>00:01:32,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:34,244</end-time>
                <translation>每个人都曾想读一次</translation>
                <original>誰もが一度読んでみたいと思いながらも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="15">
                <start-time>00:01:34,244</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,475</end-time>
                <translation>却一直难以拿起的名著</translation>
                <original>なかなか手に取ることのできない名著を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="16">
                <start-time>00:01:36,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:37,480</end-time>
                <translation>用25分钟一集 共4集</translation>
                <original>25分かける4回</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="17">
                <start-time>00:01:37,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:39,925</end-time>
                <translation>也就是100分钟来通俗易懂地解读的100分de名著</translation>
                <original>つまり100分de分かりやすく読み解く100分de名著</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="18">
                <start-time>00:01:39,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,875</end-time>
                <translation>-堀尾正明　-泷口友里奈
-堀尾正明です　-瀧口友里奈です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="19">
                <start-time>00:01:41,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:44,425</end-time>
                <translation>那么 马基雅维利的《君主论》</translation>
                <original>さあマキャベリ君主論も</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="20">
                <start-time>00:01:44,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:45,850</end-time>
                <translation>也迎来了最后一集</translation>
                <original>最終回を向かいました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="21">
                <start-time>00:01:45,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:47,700</end-time>
                <translation>我们学习了理想的领导者是什么样的？</translation>
                <original>理想のリーダーとはどういうものか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="22">
                <start-time>00:01:47,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:50,625</end-time>
                <translation>如何读懂和抓住人心</translation>
                <original>で人の心の読み方掴み方学んでまいりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="23">
                <start-time>00:01:50,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:53,575</end-time>
                <translation>领导者必须能够做出决断</translation>
                <original>リーダーというのはやはりこう決断ができなければいけないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="24">
                <start-time>00:01:53,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:55,250</end-time>
                <translation>泷口都有什么感悟呢？</translation>
                <original>瀧口さんはどんなふうに思いましたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="25">
                <start-time>00:01:55,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:59,425</end-time>
                <translation>治理国家果然需要强大的觉悟</translation>
                <original>もう国を治めるには強い覚悟が必要なんだな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="26">
                <start-time>00:01:59,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:00,800</end-time>
                <translation>这一点是我最关心的</translation>
                <original>っていうところが一番関心</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="27">
                <start-time>00:02:00,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:02,172</end-time>
                <translation>因为不仅仅是人际关系</translation>
                <original>人間関係だけじゃないですからね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="28">
                <start-time>00:02:02,172</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:04,300</end-time>
                <translation>而是国与国之间的谈判</translation>
                <original>国と国との交渉だからね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="29">
                <start-time>00:02:04,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:06,409</end-time>
                <translation>那么 今天第4集</translation>
                <original>さあ今日第4回はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="30">
                <start-time>00:02:06,409</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,050</end-time>
                <translation>我们将以精明谈判的诀窍为主题为您呈现</translation>
                <original>賢い交渉の壺というテーマでお送りします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="31">
                <start-time>00:02:10,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:15,151</end-time>
                <translation>这次我们将从外交官马基雅维利以及他的谈判技巧来解读《君主论》
今回は外交官マキャベリーそして彼の交渉術を君主論</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="32">
                <start-time>00:02:15,151</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:18,575</end-time>
                <translation>然后 从他从前线发回国内的报告中</translation>
                <original>そして彼が現場から国へと送った報告書から</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="33">
                <start-time>00:02:18,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:20,690</end-time>
                <translation>我想试着进行解读</translation>
                <original>読み解いてまいりたいというふうに思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="34">
                <start-time>00:02:20,690</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,659</end-time>
                <translation>那么 让我们有请老师出场</translation>
                <original>さあそれでは先生においでいただきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="35">
                <start-time>00:02:22,659</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:27,497</end-time>
                <translation>指导者是星美学园短期大学副教授武田好女士
ご指南役は星美学園短期大学準教授でいらっしゃる武田好さんです</translation>
