                <start-time>00:02:40,610</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:42,025</end-time>
                <translation>非常简洁 堪称名篇
実に簡潔で名文</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="42">
                <start-time>00:02:42,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,780</end-time>
                <translation>没有冗余 有一种让人拼命跟上他思维速度的固定节奏</translation>
                <original>無駄がなくって彼の頭の速さに一生懸命ついていくような一定のリズムがあります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="43">
                <start-time>00:02:46,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:47,380</end-time>
