            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="127">
                <start-time>00:07:18,254</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:19,875</end-time>
                <translation>最后再付钱</translation>
                <original>最後にお金を払います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="128">
                <start-time>00:07:22,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:25,975</end-time>
                <translation>哪有这种荒唐事 先付钱</translation>
                <original>そんな馬鹿な話があるか先に金を払え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="129">
                <start-time>00:07:28,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:32,450</end-time>
                <translation>马基雅维利逐渐被逼入绝境 向佛罗伦萨政府申诉</translation>
