            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="130">
                <start-time>00:07:34,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:38,025</end-time>
                <translation>国王陛下对佛罗伦萨心怀不满</translation>
                <original>国王陛下はフィレンツェに不満を持っています</original>
