            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="140">
                <start-time>00:08:12,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:14,777</end-time>
                <translation>即便如此 双方的想法不同</translation>
                <original>それにしても両者の考え方が違うし</original>
