            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="146">
                <start-time>00:08:31,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:34,575</end-time>
                <translation>他申诉说优柔寡断是不行的</translation>
                <original>優柔不断ではダメだというふうに訴えています</original>
