            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="147">
                <start-time>00:08:34,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:38,500</end-time>
                <translation>佛罗伦萨为什么一直拖延呢？</translation>
                <original>フィレンツェはどうして先延ばしにしているんですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="148">
                <start-time>00:08:38,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:41,825</end-time>
                <translation>说起来佛罗伦萨这个国家总是走中间路线</translation>
                <original>だいたいフィレンツェという国はいつも中道で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="149">
                <start-time>00:08:41,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:44,840</end-time>
                <translation>拖延时间 尽量往后拖</translation>
