            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="151">
                <start-time>00:08:47,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:50,625</end-time>
                <translation>这一直就是他们的方针</translation>
                <original>それがずっとそういう方針だったんですよね</original>
