            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="158">
                <start-time>00:09:10,132</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:12,725</end-time>
                <translation>正如马基雅维利最初所说的那样 </translation>
                <original>まさにマキャベリーが最初に言ったように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="159">
                <start-time>00:09:12,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:16,550</end-time>
                <translation>总之先占领 之后再付钱 </translation>
                <original>とにかく早く占領してくれた後からお金を払うと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="160">
                <start-time>00:09:16,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:20,200</end-time>
                <translation>一开始就不断向对方强调己方的立场</translation>
                <original>こちらの立場をガンガン相手に言うわけですよね最初は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="161">
                <start-time>00:09:20,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:23,150</end-time>
                <translation>然而对方并不轻易上钩</translation>
                <original>ところが相手はうまく乗ってこない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="162">
                <start-time>00:09:23,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,875</end-time>
                <translation>于是接下来就拼命对自己的国王 </translation>
                <original>そうすると今度は自分の王様に対して一生懸命ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="163">
                <start-time>00:09:26,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:29,450</end-time>
