                <start-time>00:09:45,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:47,575</end-time>
                <translation>然后再以此为基础与本国交涉</translation>
                <original>今度はそれを踏まえて本国とやる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" hasRuby="0" time="" vertical="0" torder="1" index="171">
                <start-time>00:09:47,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:49,340</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得真的一模一样</translation>
